the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    Härtefall anerkennen holds for *a case*.
    Begründung laut Gutachten plausibel holds for *a case*.
    Begründung plausibel holds for *a case*.
    Begründung laut Gutachten plausibel is judged to hold for *a case*; open textured.
    Begründung plausibel is judged to hold for *a case*; open textured.

the knowledge base r4_9_hardship_plausibility_check includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/hardship-plausibility-check.ruml".

bgb 823 is published at "/akn/de/act/1896-08-18/bgb#sec_823__subsec_1".

guidelines is published at "https://www.example.gov/haertefall-richtlinien.pdf".

Härtefall anerkennen holds for a case if
    Begründung laut Gutachten plausibel holds for the case
    and Begründung plausibel holds for the case.

Begründung laut Gutachten plausibel holds for a case if
    Begründung laut Gutachten plausibel is judged to hold for the case.

Begründung plausibel holds for a case if
    Begründung plausibel is judged to hold for the case.

scenario generated_1 is, as stated in "hardship-plausibility-check.ruml" at generated_1:
    % no data
    node_1 expects answers ["Härtefall anerkennen holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Härtefall anerkennen holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_2 expects answers ["Begründung laut Gutachten plausibel holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_2 expects answers ["it is not the case that Begründung laut Gutachten plausibel holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_3 expects answers ["Begründung plausibel holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_3 expects answers ["it is not the case that Begründung plausibel holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.

query node_1 is:
    Härtefall anerkennen holds for case 1.

query not_node_1 is:
    it is not the case that Härtefall anerkennen holds for case 1.

query node_2 is:
    Begründung laut Gutachten plausibel holds for case 1.

query not_node_2 is:
    it is not the case that Begründung laut Gutachten plausibel holds for case 1.

query node_3 is:
    Begründung plausibel holds for case 1.

query not_node_3 is:
    it is not the case that Begründung plausibel holds for case 1.

